# ============================================================
# Apple Intelligence / Siri / Private Cloud Compute 规则
# Source: https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555
#         （Apple 官方《Use Apple products on enterprise networks》
#          "Apple Intelligence, Siri, and Search" 章节，2026-08-07 更新：
#          guzzoni.apple.com、*.smoot.apple.com、apple-relay.apple.com、
#          apple-relay.fastly-edge.com、apple-relay.cloudflare.com、
#          cp4.cloudflare.com 均为官方逐主机列出的用途域）
#         apple-relay.akamaized.net / apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net：
#         社区来源（blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script issue #1598、
#         hagezi/dns-blocklists apple-private-relay.txt）；
#         DNS 证实 apple-relay.apple.com CNAME → apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net
#         apple-wit：社区前瞻关键字（curtinp118/Loon、7ohnkuu/quantx 收录；
#         当前 DNS 无解析，保留作前瞻匹配）
# Upstream: https://github.com/curtinp118/Loon (rules/AppleIntelligence.list)
#           https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/issues/1598
# Retrieved: 2026-11-11
# Policy: overridden by force-policy=AI
# 范围说明（2026-11-11 收窄）：仅保留 AI/Siri/PCC 专属域；
# 苹果生态主域（apple.com/icloud.com/me.com 等）交由上游
# blackmatrix7 Apple.list 处理（Apple 策略组，直连优先）；
# app-measurement.com 实为 Google Firebase Analytics 域名（归属错误）已移除；
# apple-livephotos.com 官方域名为 apple-livephotoskit.com（已在 Apple.list）。
# ============================================================

# Apple Intelligence / Siri / Search（官方 101555）
HOST-KEYWORD,apple-wit,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com,no-policy
HOST,guzzoni.apple.com,no-policy

# Private Cloud Compute / Apple Intelligence Extensions（官方 101555 + 社区补充）
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.apple.com,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.cloudflare.com,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.akamaized.net,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,apple-relay.mask.apple-dns.net,no-policy
HOST-SUFFIX,cp4.cloudflare.com,no-policy
